#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:2
msgid "注册人脸身份"
msgstr "Register face identity"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:4
msgid "在DaoAI World的设置页面，可以点击人脸身份库。"
msgstr ""
"On the settings page of DaoAI World, you can click Face Identity Library."

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:10
msgid "注册新档案"
msgstr "Register new profile"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:12
msgid "点击左侧菜单中的 **人脸识别**，进入人脸库管理模块。点击【注册新档案】，进入如下页面："
msgstr ""
"Click **Face Recognition** in the left menu to enter the face database "
"management module.Click [Register New Profile] to enter the following page:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:19
msgid "字段说明"
msgstr "Field description"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:21
msgid "**姓名/ID** （必填）：输入该员工的识别唯一标识（如姓名、工号等）"
msgstr ""
"**Name/ID** (required): Enter the employee’s unique identifier (such as "
"name, job number, etc.)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:22
msgid "**备注** （选填）：可用于填写所属班组、角色等描述信息"
msgstr ""
"**Remarks** (optional): Can be used to fill in descriptive information such "
"as team, role, etc."

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:23
msgid "**图片** （必填）：支持以下两种方式上传图像："
msgstr ""
"**Image** (required): Supports the following two methods to upload images:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:25
msgid "拖拽人脸图像到上传框内"
msgstr "Drag the face image into the upload box"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:26
msgid "点击【选择文件】上传本地图片"
msgstr "Click [Select File] to upload local images"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:27
msgid "或点击【使用摄像头】通过 USB 摄像头现场拍照"
msgstr "Or click [Use Camera] to take photos on-site through USB camera"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:30
msgid "照片要求"
msgstr "photo request"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:32
msgid "为确保后续识别效果，上传照片需满足以下标准："
msgstr ""
"To ensure subsequent recognition results, uploaded photos must meet the "
"following standards:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:34
msgid "**图像质量**"
msgstr "**Image Quality**"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:36
msgid "图像必须清晰、对焦准确，不可模糊"
msgstr "The image must be clear, in focus, and not blurry"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:37
msgid "支持彩色或黑白图像，背景清晰，无反光，无阴影"
msgstr ""
"Support color or black and white images, clear background, no reflection, no"
" shadow"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:38
msgid "避免强光直射或逆光，应保证脸部与背景明暗区分清晰"
msgstr ""
"Avoid direct sunlight or backlighting, and ensure that the face and "
"background are clearly distinguished from light and dark."

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:39
msgid "建议正面直视，展现完整面部特征"
msgstr ""
"It is recommended to look straight forward to show the complete facial "
"features"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:42
msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Things to note"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:44
msgid "每个用户仅需注册一次，系统会自动提取并存储特征向量"
msgstr ""
"Each user only needs to register once, and the system will automatically "
"extract and store feature vectors"

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:45
msgid "建议优先使用高清摄像头采集，以提升后续识别准确率"
msgstr ""
"It is recommended to give priority to using high-definition camera "
"collection to improve subsequent recognition accuracy."

#: ../../source/user_guide/faceID.rst:46
msgid "如需删除已注册人员，请返回识别库主界面，点击人员头像管理"
msgstr ""
"If you need to delete a registered person, please return to the main "
"interface of the identification library and click Personnel Avatar "
"Management"
